# Code owners are requested for review automatically on every pull request.
#
# Their approval is currently ADVISORY: the branch ruleset requires 0 approvals
# and has "Require review from Code Owners" off, because requiring a second
# person would stall a project this small. Reviews are still requested and still
# expected — see CONTRIBUTING.md. When the approval requirement moves to 1, turn
# the Code Owners rule on with it.
#
# This uses a team rather than individual handles so that adding or removing a
# maintainer is a team-membership change, not a pull request against this file.
#
# PREREQUISITE: the @surfrider-SD-BSA/maintainers team must exist AND have write
# access to this repository. If it does not, every line here is invalid and
# GitHub requests no reviews — and if Code Owners review is ever required while
# the team is missing, nothing can be merged. See docs/repo-setup.md section 1.
#
# Check syntax any time by opening .github/CODEOWNERS on github.com; GitHub
# flags invalid owners inline.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                       @surfrider-SD-BSA/maintainers

# Governance files — changes here should get extra eyes.
/.github/               @surfrider-SD-BSA/maintainers
/LICENSE                @surfrider-SD-BSA/maintainers
/SECURITY.md            @surfrider-SD-BSA/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @surfrider-SD-BSA/maintainers
